### **Page 2 (IMG_4006.jpg)**

**Commands**

* **To Configure WINRM with default Settings:** Winrm quickconfig / Winrm qc
* **To Enumerate WinRM Listner:** WinRM Enumerate winRM/config/listener
* **To check WinRM Configuration:** Winrm get winrm/config
* **To set authentication / change authentication:** Winrm set winrm/config/client/auth @{Digest="False"}
* **To use WinRM remotely:** Winrm e winrm/config/listener -r:{Hostname}
* **WinRS example Command:** WinRS -r:{Hostname} ipconfig

**User policy for MSI**

* HKCU \ Software \ Policies \ Microsoft \ Windows \ installer

**Computer Policy for MSI**

* HKLM \ Software \ Policies \ Microsoft \ Windows \ installer

**Disable Clipboard in RDP**

* fdisableclip = 1 (Uncheck) and 0 (Checked)
* **Path:** HKLM \ System \ CurrentControlSet \ Control \ TerminalServer
* **GPO:** Computer Config -> Policies -> Windows Settings -> Security Settings -> Local Policies -> User rights Management

**Enable / Disable from GPO**

* Administrative Templates -> Windows Components -> Remote Desktop Services -> Remote Desktop Session Host -> Devices and Resource redirection
* "Do not allow Clipboard Redirection" (Enable)



